Z||000000||Uaana||04-02-2000||03:41 AM||||Well I went out and washed and waxed my 87GT<BR>today... And after seeing close up all the defects, red coming through on the hood ect ect. and the fact that it has SE seats that were horribly recovered... And now the GF just bought an 97 Dodge Stratus fully loaded pwr everything with leather ect. ect. Any one got 3 grand to donate to my "project"?<BR>All I can say is that the engine only has 60 grand on it and runs like a champ.. now if it wasn't so ugly...  Maybe I'll only take it out at night and never look at it from closer than 50' in the daylight.<BR>Thanks for letting me ramble but after seeing all the fine cars that everone has one here, and how they got them for a pez dispenser and 2 pokemon trading cards it's tough to stay positive.||||reg||1
