Z||000003||DXR_DAD||04-02-2000||04:09 AM||||Don't think about that,  your in the right place to get that baby in shape. I have got so much info from this fourm, I can't even start to thank all the people who helped me. Most of the time I just listen to what every body has to say and go from there. Even when I take my car to the shop (when I can't do it myslef) I know what I want and what I want the mechanic to do!! The parts that I needed..., I got from fourm members.<P>Just hang on and it will all pay off!! <BR>One FieroN to another: It's who we are, It's what we do.   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>Just my late night thoughts<BR>DXR_DAD<P><p>[This message has been edited by DXR_DAD (edited 04-02-2000).]||||reg||1
