Z||000005||Ozzy||04-02-2000||04:19 AM||||Ditto dude...<P>My first Fiero was an '88 Coupe. It looked ok but the "Iron Puke" 4 banger ran like crap. Even held me up on the interstate once. I nearly set fire to it! But after some perserverance and time it is running like a charm and handling great. I find when I don't have the cash for the larger projects, there are lots of little detail type things I do to keep moving forward withh the car...you know, like that mis adjusted door or loose trims, rattles, sticking switches, blown bulbs whatever. <P>It does take effort though. It is not going to fix itself so hang with and it will reward yoo! <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">||||reg||1
